This allows your users to download everything (or whichever you want)
in your SysText:Help/ directory for later reading.

First you must create an archive of all the help files you want and
place it somewhere (I left it in the Help directory).

Add the following to your bbsmenu under the "2; Available everywhere"
heading below everything else:

DHELP |{#0PFiles:DownloadHelp}

Add the command to your menu(s) and that's it.

The above { is actually a control-Q commands and remember to modify the
path to where you placed the "DownloadHelp" script.
